{"title":"Jackalhide Head","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Leatherworking Lv 20) · Monster drop: Werewolf, Marksman Pell, Glimmerfox</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Leatherworking at level 20 <span class=\"muted\">(458 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/jackal-pelt\">Jackal Pelt</a>, 2× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"pirate-marksman\" title=\"Marksman Pell - dropped it in 1 of 2 looted corpses (1/2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/d415e0acd3d4d7a1c5ca.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Marksman Pell</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"glimmerfox\" title=\"Glimmerfox - dropped it in 1 of 266 looted corpses (1/266)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7418be6744e1d02a8b58.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glimmerfox</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/266<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf - dropped it in 2 of 3,778 looted corpses (1/1,889)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0ebf199ce603121d6b69.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,889<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"jackalhide-head\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/jackal-pelt\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/a527c3adeb957a426463.svg\" alt=\"\">Jackal Pelt</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/cd220ec8b4588ac36d9c.svg\" alt=\"Jackalhide Head\"></div><h3>Jackalhide Head</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Leatherworking 20</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/27/2026, 9:30:59 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}